### 1. Отримати JWT для ADMIN (Oleksandra)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "oleksandra@mail.com",
  "password": "admin"
}

### 2. Отримати JWT для USER (Tom)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tom@mail.com",
  "password": "user"
}

